7. Accordingly, the following order:
ORDER (i) The appeal is allowed in part;
(ii) The claimant is entitled to total compensation of Rs.3,03,600/- along with interest at the rate of 6% per annum from the date of petition till the date of realization as against Rs.2,09,880/- awarded by the tribunal;

(iii) The Insurance company is directed to deposit the enhanced compensation of Rs.93,720/-
NC: 2025:KHC-K:7383 HC-KAR along with interest within one month from the date of this order;
(iv) On such deposit, the claimant is permitted to withdraw the enhanced amount along with interest accrued on it;
